    "body": "Thanks for confirming the terms and pointing me to this tracker. Before starting, could you clarify one part of the rule: does “no automated submissions” also apply to coding assistants and test automation, or specifically to automated claims and PR posting? I understand that the fix needs a real successful boot and a capture of the working desktop.",
